      "description": "Question: When did tokens per productive output vs baseline cross its SLO? Rolling $slo_window value; honours the Workflow variable.\nMetrics: Tier A: emitted by gh-aw.\nSLI: C1.\nSLO: ≤ 1.5× (amber ≤ 2×).",
