      "description": "Question: When did cache hit ratio cross its SLO? Rolling $slo_window value; honours the Workflow variable.\nMetrics: Tier A: emitted by gh-aw.\nSLI: C3.\nSLO: ≥ 40% (amber ≥ 20%).",
